    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Nurses worldwide have drawn the attention of public and policy-makers towards investing in education, health care and sound social policy for alleviating poverty. In line with this call by the international nursing community, Aga Khan University (AKU) celebrated International Nurses Day on May 15, 2004.",
